<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project>
  <fileVersion>
    <major>6</major>
    <minor>9</minor>
    <build>0</build>
  </fileVersion>
  <title>TurboExo ADS1115 compact carrier Rev G</title>
  <author>TurboExo</author>
  <description>REV G: external optocoupler and Pi J2 require separate pigtails. Charger trigger isolated from Pi rails. 24x18 individual pad board. TOP coordinate view. Colored wires are insulated underneath; bends/crossings are not soldered. P_BUS and G_BUS segments form bare continuous buses joined only at listed taps. Fuel/oil connect directly to A0/A1. R3 oil bias empty. J5/J6 passive isolated Pi J2 extension, separate two-wire lead. No formal HAT compliance. Physical fit and electrical tests not performed. See guide.</description>
  <width value="180.0" unit="mm"/>
  <height value="115.0" unit="mm"/>
  <gridSpacing value="0.1" unit="in"/>
